n>Enums</span></h2><ul class="nav-list"><li><a class="nav-row" href="Units.html" title="Units (enum)"><span class="glyph" data-tone="enum" aria-hidden="true">E</span><span class="nav-label">Units</span></a></li></ul></section><section class="nav-section"><h2 class="nav-heading"><span>Exceptions</span></h2><ul class="nav-list"><li><a class="nav-row" href="GeometryException.html" title="GeometryException (class)"><span class="glyph" data-tone="exception" aria-hidden="true">X</span><span class="nav-label">GeometryException</span></a></li></ul></section><section class="nav-section"><h2 class="nav-heading"><span>Annotations</span></h2><ul class="nav-list"><li><a class="nav-row" href="Measured.html" title="Measured (annotation)"><span class="glyph" data-tone="annotation" aria-hidden="true">@</span><span class="nav-label">Measured</span></a></li></ul></section></nav><script>(function(){var n=document.getElementById("apidocs-nav");if(!n)return;try{var k="apidocs-nav:"+new URL(document.documentElement.getAttribute("data-root")||"./",location.href).pathname;var s=sessionStorage.getItem(k);if(s)n.scrollTop=+s}catch(e){}var c=n.querySelector('[aria-current="page"]');if(c&&(c.offsetTop<n.scrollTop||c.offsetTop>n.scrollTop+n.clientHeight-40))n.scrollTop=Math.max(0,c.offsetTop-n.clientHeight/3)})()</script><main id="content" class="content"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs"><ol><li><a href="../../index.html">fixture</a></li><li><a href="index.html">fixture.java</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Geometry</span></li></ol></nav><header class="page-head"><h1 data-kind="class"><span class="glyph glyph-large" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span>Geometry</h1><p class="page-meta"><span class="kind-word">class</span><span class="in-package">in <a href="index.html"><code>fixture.java</code></a></span><span class="badge badge-since">since 1.0</span><span class="badge badge-non-null" title="JSpecify @NullMarked: types are non-null unless annotated">null-marked</span></p></header><div class="sig sig-large"><pre><code><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">final</span> <span class="tk-k">class</span> <span class="tk-n">Geometry</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="true" hidden aria-label="Copy signature" title="Copy signature">Copy</button></div><dl class="lineage"><div><dt>Inheritance</dt><dd><ol class="chain"><li><a href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html"><code>Object</code></a></li><li aria-current="true"><code>Geometry</code></li></ol></dd></div></dl><section id="doc-description" class="prose"><p>Operations on <a href="Shape.html"><code>shapes</code></a>.</p><p>Every method is <em>pure</em>: it never modifies its arguments. <strong>Thread safety:</strong> every method is safe to call concurrently.</p><ul><li><p><a href="Geometry.html#largest(java.util.Collection)"><code>largest(Collection)</code></a> picks the largest shape.</p></li><li><p><a href="Geometry.html#totalArea(fixture.java.Shape...)"><code>totalArea(Shape...)</code></a> sums areas.</p></li></ul><ol><li><p>First, measure.</p></li><li><p>Then compare, with <code>compareTo</code>.</p></li></ol><div class="table-scroll"><table class="doc-table"><caption>Unit factors</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Unit</th><th scope="col">Factor</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="Units.html#METERS"><code>Units.METERS</code></a></td><td>1.0</td></tr><tr><td><a href="Units.html#FEET"><code>Units.FEET</code></a></td><td>0.3048</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="code-block"><pre data-lang="java"><code><span class="hl-t">Shape</span> big = <span class="hl-t">Geometry</span>.<span class="hl-f">largest</span>(<span class="hl-t">List</span>.<span class="hl-f">of</span>(<span class="hl-t">Circle</span>.<span class="hl-f">of</span>(<span class="hl-n">1</span>), <span class="hl-t">Rect</span>.<span class="hl-f">square</span>(<span class="hl-n">2</span>)));
<span class="hl-k">double</span> total = <span class="hl-t">Geometry</span>.<span class="hl-f">totalArea</span>(big, <span class="hl-t">Circle</span>.<span class="hl-f">of</span>(<span class="hl-n">3</span>));</code></pre><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="true" hidden aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code">Copy</button></div><blockquote><p>Measure twice, cut once.</p></blockquote><h2 class="doc-heading">Edge cases</h2><p>Text with an entity — a <span class="raw"><sup>superscript</sup></span> kept as raw markup, a line<br/> break, a <a href="https://example.com/spec">hyperlink</a>, and &lt;angle brackets> as literal text.</p></section><div class="callout callout-implNote" role="note"><span class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16"><path d="M6 4.5 2.75 8 6 11.5M10 4.5 13.25 8 10 11.5"></path></svg></span><div class="callout-body"><p class="callout-label">Implementation note</p><p>Areas are computed in double precision.</p></div></div><div class="see"><h2 class="facts-title">See also</h2><ul class="see-list"><li><a href="Shape.html"><code>Shape</code></a></li><li><a href="Shape.html#area()"><code>the area of a shape</code></a></li><li>&quot;Euclid, Elements, Book I&quot;</li><li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Area">Area</a></li></ul></div><section id="nested-types" class="section"><h2>Nested types</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table class="summary"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Kind</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a class="type-link" href="Geometry.Legacy.html"><span class="glyph" data-tone="class" aria-hidden="true">C</span><code>Legacy</code></a></th><td class="kind-cell">class</td><td>Methods from before null markings; their nullness is unspecified.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id="member-summary" class="section"><h2>Member summary</h2><div class="summary-group"><h3>Fields</h3><div class="table-scroll"><table class="summary"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="summary-sig"><span class="tk-k">static </span><span class="tk-k">int</span> <a href="Geometry.html#PRECISION">PRECISION</a></code></th><td>The default number of significant digits: <code>6</code>.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="summary-sig"><span class="tk-k">static </span><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html">String</a> <a href="Geometry.html#NAME">NAME</a></code></th><td>The library's name, <a href="Geometry.html#NAME"><code><code>&quot;fixture&quot;</code></code></a>, as tools report it.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="summary-group"><h3>Methods</h3><div class="table-scroll"><table class="summary"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code class="summary-sig"><span class="tk-k">static </span><span class="tk-tp">T</span> <a href="Geometry.html#largest(java.util.Collection)">largest</a>(<span><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html">Collection</a></span>)</code></th><td>Returns the largest shape.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="summary-sig"><span class="tk-k">static </span><span class="tk-k">double</span> <a href="Geometry.html#totalArea(fixture.java.Shape...)">totalArea</a>(<span><a class="tk-t" href="Shape.html">Shape</a>...</span>)</code></th><td>Sums the shapes' areas.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="summary-sig"><span class="tk-k">static </span><a class="tk-t" href="Shape.html">Shape</a> <a href="Geometry.html#parse(java.lang.String)">parse</a>(<span><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html">String</a></span>)</code></th><td>Parses a shape from its text form, such as <code>circle 2.5</code>.</td></tr><tr class="is-deprecated"><th scope="row"><code class="summary-sig"><span class="tk-k">static </span><span class="tk-k">double</span> <a href="Geometry.html#sum(java.util.List)">sum</a>(<span><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html">List</a></span>)</code></th><td><span class="badge badge-deprecated">deprecated</span>Sums the areas of a list of shapes.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code class="summary-sig"><span class="tk-k">static </span><a class="tk-t" href="Shape.html">Shape</a> <a href="Geometry.html#find(java.util.Map,java.lang.String)">find</a>(<span><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html">Map</a></span><span>, <a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html">String</a></span>)</code></th><td>Finds a shape by name.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section id="field-details" class="section members"><h2>Fields</h2><section class="member" id="PRECISION" data-kind="field"><header class="member-head"><h3 class="member-name"><a class="anchor" href="Geometry.html#PRECISION" aria-label="Field PRECISION">PRECISION</a></h3><span class="member-badges"><span class="badge">static</span></span></header><div class="sig"><pre><code><span class="tk-k">public</span> <span class="tk-k">static</span> <span class="tk-k">final</span> <span class="tk-k">int</span> <span class="tk-n">PRECISION</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="true" hidden aria-label="Copy signature" title="Copy signature">Copy</button></div><div class="prose"><p>The default number of significant digits: <code>6</code>.</p></div><div class="facts"><h4 class="facts-title">Value</h4><dl class="facts-list facts-unnamed"><div class="fact"><dt><code class="fact-type"><span class="tk-k">int</span></code></dt><dd>Constant: <code>6</code></dd></div></dl></div></section><section class="member" id="NAME" data-kind=