pan class="tk-tp">T</span> <span class="tk-n">largest</span>(
    <a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html">Collection</a>&lt;? <span class="tk-k">extends</span> <span class="tk-tp">T</span>> <span class="tk-p">shapes</span>
)</code></pre><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="true" hidden aria-label="Copy signature" title="Copy signature">Copy</button></div><div class="prose"><p>Returns the largest shape.</p></div><div class="facts"><h4 class="facts-title">Type parameters</h4><dl class="facts-list"><div class="fact"><dt><code class="fact-name">&lt;T></code></dt><dd>the shape type</dd></div></dl></div><div class="facts"><h4 class="facts-title">Parameters</h4><dl class="facts-list"><div class="fact"><dt><code class="fact-name">shapes</code><code class="fact-type"><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html">Collection</a>&lt;? <span class="tk-k">extends</span> <span class="tk-tp">T</span>></code><span class="badge badge-non-null" title="Never null">non-null</span></dt><dd>the shapes; not empty</dd></div></dl></div><div class="facts"><h4 class="facts-title">Returns</h4><dl class="facts-list facts-unnamed"><div class="fact"><dt><code class="fact-type"><span class="tk-tp">T</span></code></dt><dd>the largest of <code>shapes</code></dd></div></dl></div><div class="facts"><h4 class="facts-title">Throws</h4><dl class="facts-list facts-unnamed"><div class="fact"><dt><code class="fact-type"><a class="tk-t" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/util/NoSuchElementException.html">NoSuchElementException</a></code><span class="badge" title="Unchecked; not in the throws clause">unchecked</span></dt><dd>if <code>shapes</code> is empty</dd></div></dl></div><div class="callout callout-implSpec" role="note"><span class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16"><rect x="2.75" y="2.75" width="10.5" height="10.5" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M5.4 8.2l1.8 1.8 3.4-3.9"></path></svg></span><div class="callout-body"><p class="callout-label">Implementation requirements</p><p>Compares with <a href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Comparable.html#compareTo(T)"><code>Comparable.compareTo(Object)</code></a>, keeping the first of equal shapes.</p></div></div></section><section class="member" id="totalArea(fixture.java.Shape...)" data-kind="method"><header class="member-head"><h3 class="member-name"><a class="anchor" href="Geometry.html#totalArea(fixture.java.Shape...)" aria-label="Method totalArea">totalArea</a></h3><span class="member-badges"><span class="badge">static</span></span></header><div class="sig"><pre><code><span class="sig-annotation"><a class="tk-a" href="Measured.html">@Measured</a>(<span class="tk-p">precision</span> = <span class="tk-l">6</span>)
